## Acceptance

- [ ] Settings shows **Tags**; `/settings/tags` opens it
- [ ] All tags listed with name, color, usage count
- [ ] Create tag without attaching to an entity
- [ ] Rename and recolor update globally (chips elsewhere reflect after refresh/invalidation)
- [ ] Delete confirms with usage; removes tag + all taggings
