- [ ] No change to board/canvas/todo_list taggable API gate

## QA checklist (post-implement)

1. Open Settings → Tags; confirm list loads with counts.
2. Create a tag; confirm it appears with usage 0.
3. Rename a tag used on an idea/task; open that entity — name updated.
4. Recolor from Settings; chips elsewhere show new color.
5. Delete a used tag (confirm shows count); taggings gone from entities.
6. Merge two tags that share an entity and ones that don’t; verify single chip and counts.
7. Deep link `/settings/tags` and mobile-width Settings layout still usable.
